sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Rules as ReqDec / ReqSn / AckSn
  participant Snapshots as Snapshot owner
  participant Transactions as Transaction owner
  participant Audit as Independent checks
  Note over Rules,Transactions: All three parties accepted tx1 (1 → 2), tx2 (2 → 3), then decommit (3 → 4)
  Rules->>Snapshots: ReserveDecommit (3 → 4)
  Snapshots->>Transactions: Transaction (ReserveDecommit)
  Transactions-->>Rules: DecommitRecorded, local UTxO = empty
  Transactions-->>Audit: Pending inputs absent: true
  Note over Rules,Snapshots: Delayed ReqSn 1 contains tx1 only, normal validation and signing succeed
  Rules->>Snapshots: AcceptSnapshot 1, retained txs = [tx2]
  Snapshots->>Transactions: Rebase snapshot 1 with tx2
  Transactions-->>Rules: SnapshotRequested, local UTxO = {3}, decommit retained
  Transactions-->>Audit: Pending inputs absent: false
  Note over Transactions,Audit: First defect: rebase restores the reserved input
  Rules->>Snapshots: RecordSignature, verify, ConfirmSnapshot
  Snapshots-->>Rules: SnapshotConfirmed 1, confirmed UTxO = {2}
  Rules-->>Audit: Proposed ReqSn 2: [tx2] + decommit (3 → 4)
  Audit-->>Rules: Decommit inputs present in confirmed base: false
  Note over Rules,Audit: Second defect: ReqSn applies the decommit before tx2, so every party rejects
